{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Avoid consuming a plain replacement sampler during preflight.** For a visible non-`DurableSampler`, this invokes `shouldSample` to seed ancestor flags, while actual SDK span creation bypasses the carrier and invokes that sampler again. Stateful or rate-limited samplers consume an extra decision per invocation and may sample a different span set. Avoid the preflight call for plain replacements or make its result the actual span decision; add a direct stateful-sampler call-count test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7-DuJu","finding_digest":"4817f8f1a3bdbef06e7387a0c3d68ff75375b61b6f611c683891900194b4c061","finding_id":"arf_v1_jal7r4ndxw7pa3ttq6qmhvup65","finding_key":"otel-plugin/otelpluginsupport::resolvesamplingresult::visible-replacement-preflight-sampling","identity_key":"otel-plugin/otelpluginsupport::resolvesamplingresult::visible-replacement-preflight-sampling","line":169,"observation_digest":"30233754552f31e133eb0be2244979a552a1aff261249522e41ac58d6ffc8a20","observation_id":"aro_v1_gartovcvf4y6cm7lbprcislzuv","path":"otel-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/otel/OtelPluginSupport.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_jal7r4ndxw7pa3ttq6qmhvup65","published_at":"2026-10-13T18:19:24Z","review_id":"arr_v1_aijmadpi5elrp5dx77z56tmy35","reviewed_base_sha":"bdc1c708ba096fe1d20519e578f972b762242995","reviewed_head_sha":"3fab2d713e2b248ca27f12a6569529ba46388ff6","reviewer":"codex","start_line":168,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_bthpf45cv2bjnoxy7zkqcp5yhr","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-13T18:19:24Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
